@startuml SEQ_11_KALENDER_KEGIATAN
!theme plain
skinparam defaultFontSize 12
skinparam TitleFontSize 14
title Sequence Diagram — SEQ-11: Melihat Kalender Kegiatan

actor       "Admin / Asisten / Kadep" as User
boundary    "KalenderPage"            as Page
control     "KegiatanController"      as Ctrl
entity      "Kegiatan"                as ModelKegiatan

== Buka Halaman Kalender ==

User  -> Page          : Buka halaman kalender kegiatan
Page --> User : response / redirect
Page  -> Ctrl          : GET /kegiatan/kalender
Ctrl  --> Page         : Render halaman kalender
Page  --> User         : Tampil halaman kalender

== Memuat Data Events ==

Page  -> Ctrl          : GET /kegiatan/calendar-data
Ctrl --> Page : response / redirect
Ctrl  -> ModelKegiatan : Query kegiatan berstatus diajukan & disetujui
ModelKegiatan --> Ctrl : Data kegiatan
Ctrl  --> Page         : Data events kalender
Page  --> User         : Tampil event kegiatan di kalender

== Klik Event Kegiatan ==

User  -> Page          : Klik salah satu event
Page --> User : response / redirect
Page  -> Ctrl          : GET /kegiatan/{id}
Ctrl --> Page : response / redirect
Ctrl  -> ModelKegiatan : Query detail kegiatan berdasarkan id
ModelKegiatan --> Ctrl : Data detail kegiatan
Ctrl  --> Page         : Render halaman detail kegiatan
Page  --> User         : Tampil detail kegiatan

@enduml